だって急げば霧がなくて ないもの全部欲しがって 鏡を見送って
Because if you rush, the fog clears not, wanting everything that isn't there, seeing the mirror off

493
01:00:44,710 --> 01:00:48,970
ため息は 甘えだったと悩んでいた
I was fretting that my sighs were just me being spoiled.

494
01:00:48,970 --> 01:00:55,870
知らなかった みんなと同じだと知っていた ピント外れと
I didn't know... I knew I was just like everyone else, missing the point entirely,

495
01:00:59,870 --> 01:01:04,730
揺らいでいくの Maybe 神様は楽しんでる
Wavering... Maybe God is having fun

496
01:01:04,730 --> 01:01:08,370
予測できない 人を私はそれ以上に
And I'm enjoying unpredictable people even more than that!

497
01:01:08,370 --> 01:01:17,490
楽しんでやろうぜ プレッシャーとかお仕事とか諦めない 女の子だし記憶良く 愛嬌良く
Let's have fun with it! Never giving up on pressure or work, as a girl, with good memories and charm,

498
01:01:17,490 --> 01:01:21,530
たまには狂い咲いて
Blooming wildly every once in a while!

499
01:01:21,530 --> 01:01:24,550
愛してね 愛されるの
Please love me, and be loved!

500
01:01:24,550 --> 01:01:31,170
お母さんがすべてさ さあ出かけよう 毎日を大切に
Mom gave me everything, so let's head out and cherish every single day!

501
01:01:31,170 --> 01:01:35,530
愛しとぶ 愛されるの
Loving and flying, being loved,

502
01:01:35,530 --> 01:01:40,570
お母さんがすべてさ さあ飛び出そう 毎日を大切に
Mom is everything to me, so let's leap out and cherish every single day!

503
01:01:40,570 --> 01:01:47,430
胸張って生きる さらけ出せば
Living with your head held high, if you bare your heart,

504
01:01:47,430 --> 01:02:02,290
心が温められてたんだ 好きにいいてろ いたくしない
your heart will warm up... Just live as you like, it won't hurt!

505
01:02:16,690 --> 01:02:22,610
神様は夢与えた 変わるために 惨劇かましてやるよ
God gave us dreams so we could change. I'll make a tragic spectacle of it!

506
01:02:22,610 --> 01:02:29,470
最期まで付き合ってもらうよ 雨はやんで傘を閉じた
You'll stick with me until the very end. The rain stopped and I closed my umbrella,

507
01:02:29,470 --> 01:02:35,490
今まで見えてなかった景色 透明が感謝して
seeing scenery I couldn't see until now, transparent with gratitude,

508
01:02:35,490 --> 01:02:41,690
世界を照らし出す 胸踊る
illuminating the world, making my heart dance!

509
01:02:41,690 --> 01:02:46,090
可愛いとか持てたいとか 諦めない女の子だし
Wanting to be cute, wanting to be adored—as a girl, I won't give up!

510
01:02:46,090 --> 01:02:50,150
上手に愛してね
Loving so skillfully,

511
01:02:50,150 --> 01:02:56,610
愛されるの お母さんがすべてさ さあ出かけよう
being loved—Mom is everything, so let's head out!

512
01:02:56,610 --> 01:03:00,770
愛しとぶ 愛されるの
Loving and flying, being loved,

513
01:03:00,770 --> 01:03:05,250
お母さんがすべてさ さあ飛び出そう
Mom is everything, so let's leap out!

514
01:03:05,250 --> 01:03:13,390
毎日を大切に 好きに生きてやろうぜ プレッシャーとかお仕事とか 諦めない女の子だし
Cherishing every day, living however you like! Not giving up on pressure or work, as a girl,

515
01:03:13,390 --> 01:03:22,710
記憶よく 愛嬌良く たまには狂い咲いて
with good memory and charm, blooming wildly every once in a while!

516
01:03:34,430 --> 01:03:37,470
みなのの、今日は来てくれて本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you all so much for coming today!

517
01:03:37,850 --> 01:03:41,870
最高の一周年ライブになりました！
It became the best 2nd anniversary live ever!

518
01:03:41,970 --> 01:03:48,190
本当にありがとう！バイバーイでござるー！
Thank you so much! Bye-bye for now!

